Subject: [PATCH v6 21/22] drm: bridge: dw_hdmi: Remove the empty dw_hdmi_phy_update_hpd()
Date: Sat, 16 May 2026 18:38:31 +0000
Message-ID: <20260516183838.2024991-22-jonas@kwiboo.se>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.54.0
